# Push updates to GitHub

Remote: `https://github.com/NeverSMILE0825/Competitor-Tracker.git` (`origin`).

After a requested code change is finished, commit it and push to `origin` on the current branch.

- Commit only the files that belong to that change.
- Leave out `node_modules/`, `data/`, `.env`, and credential files.
- Do not force-push, skip hooks, or change git config.
- If the push fails, say so and leave the local commit in place.

```powershell
git push -u origin HEAD
```
